                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game just feels way too clunky to be any fun.  It seems to be canonical with the One Piece movies. So, story-wise, it's quite interesting, but I recommend you play this at best on normal or easy, because on hard, it's so stupidly balanced that it's just not fun.  One Piece fans, get on discount.  Everyone else, I recommend you play the Pirate Warrior games, or one piece Odyssey.",
